        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striped raccoon needs your help! He just needs a unique style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you press a key, the curious striped raccoon will diligently rub your taskbar with his paws, as if rinsing a new find in water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type, click, play, work - every action you take earns you points. The more active you are, the more chances the raccoon has to find awesome accessories for his image!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What image will you help him create? Gather a collection: hats, wigs, glasses, masks, scarves, ties and dozens more crazy, stylish and just plain funny accessories! Combine them for a unique look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the adorable prankster amass the biggest collection ever! The more you do at the computer, the more cool stuff he'll wear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890170/extras/d9646411a85b4f25c54fd7482580e58c.poster.avif?t=1755261989\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890170/extras/d9646411a85b4f25c54fd7482580e58c.webm?t=1755261989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item drop chance</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common - 88.68%*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon - 9.66%*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare - 1.40%*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic - 0.25%*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary - 0.01%*  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal** - Craft only  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade in 10 identical items of the same quality and you're guaranteed to get 1 random item of the next higher quality.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example: 10 Common → 1 Uncommon; 10 Uncommon → 1 Rare;  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trading and selling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items you get from drops and crafting available for sale  on the Steam Marketplace.***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Subject to change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>** Seasonal items drop for a limited time—only during the corresponding season.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*** Time restrictions may apply. See Steam <strong>Trading and Market Restrictions </strong>for details.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striped raccoon needs your help! He just needs a unique style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you press a key, the curious striped raccoon will diligently rub your taskbar with his paws, as if rinsing a new find in water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type, click, play, work - every action you take earns you points. The more active you are, the more chances the raccoon has to find awesome accessories for his image!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What image will you help him create? Gather a collection: hats, wigs, glasses, masks, scarves, ties and dozens more crazy, stylish and just plain funny accessories! Combine them for a unique look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the adorable prankster amass the biggest collection ever! The more you do at the computer, the more cool stuff he'll wear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890170/extras/d9646411a85b4f25c54fd7482580e58c.poster.avif?t=1755261989\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890170/extras/d9646411a85b4f25c54fd7482580e58c.webm?t=1755261989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item drop chance</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common - 88.68%*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon - 9.66%*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare - 1.40%*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic - 0.25%*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary - 0.01%*  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal** - Craft only  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade in 10 identical items of the same quality and you're guaranteed to get 1 random item of the next higher quality.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example: 10 Common → 1 Uncommon; 10 Uncommon → 1 Rare;  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trading and selling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items you get from drops and crafting available for sale  on the Steam Marketplace.***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Subject to change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>** Seasonal items drop for a limited time—only during the corresponding season.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*** Time restrictions may apply. See Steam <strong>Trading and Market Restrictions </strong>for details.</i></p>",
